OnBytes/Model/TestWeightsGiven.lean: the layout of the committed matrix of weights at a small
configuration, spelled out here, compared with the numbers of the C++ verifier. The test runs when
this file compiles.

The program does not import this file.

The two lists below are the C++ verifier's: the fields of the layout as WsLay::build
(verifier/src/vf_weights_layout.h) leaves them in runStage (verifier/src/cp_verify.cpp) for the
shape below, in a planning call on public files with this shape. They were printed by added print
statements, which are not part of the repository. They hold every unit and every index group of the
layout. The shape was printed there as
D L d dh dkv dq f fe NE V eh MOE = 2048 8 512 128 256 512 1024 512 4 512 1 1, with lkW = 11.
-/
